<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">Ephesuste</book>
  <para style="h">Ephesuste</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ephesuste</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ephesuste</para>
  <para style="mt">Ephesuste</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian ii deina taw Christ Jesus ii sawltak khat ahi Paul in — Jesus taw kipumkhat nuntakna sungah a thumaan Ephesus khua Pathian ii mihingte tungah lai kong thaak hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ih Pa Pathian le Jesus Christ in thuthiamna le thinnopna hong pia tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ih Topa Jesus Christ ii Pa le Pathian tungah lungdamko tawng! Banghang ziam cile Christ taw kipumkhatna sungah ama in eite sia vantung ngam taw kisai thaa thupha theampo hong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Christ taw kipumkhatna tungtawnin, ama mai ah sit baang ngawl le ih thiantho natu in, Pathian in leitung a vawt ma ngawngawn in eite hong teal zo hi. Hong itna hangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian in Jesus Christ tungtawnin a tapa a tanute hong suasak natu in a khensat sa hi a — hi thu in ama diksak le tupna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A minthang a thuthiamna hu le a it a Tapa sungah eite a thawthongin hong piak letsong hu in, Pathian pok tawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Christ ii chisan hangin eite kisuakta a, tua thu in ih mawna kimaisak hi, cinopna hi. Pathian ii thuthiamna bangza in lian ziam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tua in, hi za ta a lian mama eite hong piak thuthiamna ahi hi! Ama ciimna theampo le a thuk mu theina taw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian in a tupna sa bangin vawt a, a pawlcing tu in a khensat sa ama tupna thuku sia Christ zanghin, eite hong hesak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A hun hong tun ciangin Pathian ii a khuangkhim tu, hi tupna in vantung leitung ah bitphua sa theampo kaikhawm tu a, a lutang tu in Christ koi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na theampo sia Pathian ii tupna le khensatna bangin kiseam a; Pathian in a kipatciil pan mama in a khensatsa thu bulphu in, ama ii tupna hu in eite Christ taw kipumkhat a, ama aituam mihingte ih sua natu in hong teal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahikom Christ sungah lametna a nei phit eite in, Pathian ii minthanna pok tawng!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />No ngupna hong puak thumaan thu ahi Lungdamna Thupha sia na zaak uh ciang, note zongh Pathian ii mihingte na suak uh hi. Note in Christ na um uh a, tuaciang Pathian in hong kamciamsa Thaa Thiangtho hong piakna taw ama ii neisa na hina uh tepteena tazeik note tungah hong tuum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua Thaa in Pathian ii mihingte hong kamciam sate ih nga natu kipsakna hi a, ama ii neisa ahite tungah suatakna a cingin Pathian in hong pia tu hi ci in hong lungmuangsak hi. Ama ii minthanna pok tawng!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hi thu hu in, Pathian ii mihingte na itna uh le Topa Jesus na upna uhte ka zaak nungsang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />note atu in Pathian tungah lungdamkona ka tawlnga ngei bua hi. Ka thungetnate sungah kong phawk a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />ih Topa Jesus Christ ii Pathian, a vaanglian Pa tungah nang hong ciimsak a ama na heak natu le Pathian hong lak tu Thaa hong piak natu in, ka ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bang lametna nei tu in note hong sam a, a mite a piak tu a, a kamciam thuphate bangza in nasia, ci in na heak natu in na thinsung uh hong kihonsak a, a khuavak na mu thei natu in kong ngetsak hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tuaciangin ei, thu umte sungah na hong seam ama ii vaangletna sia bangza in lian ziam, ci in na heak natu kong ngetsak hi. Eite sungah na hong seam, hi a nasia thahatna in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Christ sia thina pan thosak a, vantung ama ii tokhum ziatsang ah a tosak sia ma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Christ in tua munah vantung ukpite, thuneite, vaangletna neite, tote theampo ii tung panin uk hi; ama in hi leitung ah ahizong, hong pai pheang tu leitung ah ahizong, thunei min le zate theampo sangin a lianzaw min le za nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pathian in na theampo sia Christ peang nuai ah koi a, na theampo ii ukpi Topa ahi tu in pawlpi tungah ama pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pawlpi in Christ ii pumpi hi a, kicinna ahi ama mama in mun theampo ah na theampo khuangkhim hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A bosa hun sungah note in na thunit ngawl hang le, na mawnate hangin thaa lamsang ah a thisa na hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua hunlai in note in, leitung ngitlona zia na zui uh hi; van awng sungah thaa vaangletnate a ukpa thu na ni uh hi, tua thaa in tu laitakin Pathian thu a ni ngawl mihingte a uk sia ma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A tatakin eite zongh, amate bang ih hi ngei a, ih pianpui lungngulnate taw ih nungta zo hi, ih pumpi le ih thinsung taw a kisi bangin ih seam ih vawt hi. Ih pianlim in ngualdang bangma in, Pathian thin uukna thuak tu in, a kiciangtan sa ih hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahihang Pathian ii hesuakna sia kicing lawlawm a, tuaciang eite hong itna sia lian mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua hi a eite ih thunit ngawlna taw thaa lamsang ah a thisa in ih om laitak Christ taw hong nungtasak kik hi. Pathian ii thuthiamna taw note hong kingum zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Christ Jesus taw pumkhat ih hina taw vantung ngam ah ama taw a uk khawm tu in, Pathian in eite ama taw hong thosak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hi bangin a sepna sia Christ Jesus sungah hong kilak, ki itna sungah a om, a tuanin a lian saap thuthiamna sia hong pai tu hun theampo ah a kikhomsuan tu ahi hunlam hong lakna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile note in upna tungtawnin Pathian ii thuthiamna taw ngup sa na hi uh hi. Tua in note hanciamna hang hi ngawlin, note kisuantaak thaak ngawl natu in Pathian letsong ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Eite in tu a ih hi babangin, Pathian hong vawtsa ih hi a, Jesus Christ taw kipumkhatna sungah ngamtat pha nuntakna nei natu in, hong bitphua sa ih hi hi, tua thu in eite sep tu in, hong koi kholsak sa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate le amate “Vunteap atte” (Pate ii amate pumpi tungah a vawtte cinopna) a kici Jew te in “Vunteap at ngawlte” hong ci, pianna suana pan Gentile te ahi note in, hun bosa sungah na omzia uh kiphawk tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua hunlai in note in Christ taw kikhenin a omte na hi uh hi. Note in ngamdangmite na hi uh a Pathian ii tealsa mihingte na hi bua uh hi. Pathian ii mihingte tungah a kamciamte a bulphu thuciamnate sungah na kihel bua uh a, note in hi leitung ah lametna sel le Pathian selin na nungta uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahihang tu in, Christ Jesus taw na kipumkhat uh hu in, a khuala a om ngeisa note sia Christ ii chisan hu in a nai hong kithen zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Christ ama mama in, Jew te le Gentile te minam khat hong suasakna taw eite tungah kilemna hong puak zo hi. Amate a khen, ngal a suaksak kidoina pang sia ama pumpi taw sutham zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama taw kipumkhatna hangin, minam niite sung pan, a thak minam khat a bitphua thei natu in, minam a doi Jew te ii thukhamte, a thupiakte le a zui tute theampo phiatin hong kilemsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thinglamtee tungah Christ a thi ciangin amate kilaklaw ah kingal vawtnate lalthamsak hi; ama ii thinglamtee hangin, tua minamte ngeal sia pumkhat a suak tu in ngawmtua a, Pathian kungah zotpui kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahikom Christ hong pai in Pathian taw a kikhuala, no Gentile te tung le Pathian taw a kinai Jew te tungah kilemna thu ahi Lungdamna Thupha hong hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Christ tungtawnin eite theampo, Jew te ih hi a, Gentile te ih hi zongin, Thaa khat sungah Pa omna ih theng thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahikom, Gentile te sia, ngamdang mi, khualmi hi nawn ngawl a; tu in note in Pathian ii mihingte taw ngam mipui, Pathian innkuan sungah a kihel mihingte na hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Note zongh, sawltakte le kamsaangte ii cian phungkawng tungah a kisate na hi uh a, tua phungkawng, innking suangpi sia Christ Jesus ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in inn bup a lenpa hi a, khangtosakin Topa tungah a ki aap biakinn thiangtho a suaksakpa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama taw na kipumkhatna sung uh ah note zongh, Pathian ii a Thaa taw a teenna munah ngualdangte taw hong kisa khawm hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hisia thu hu in, no Gentile te atu in Christ Jesus ii thongtaakpa keima Paul in, Pathian tungah thu ka ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Note phattuam natu in, Pathian in a thuthiamna taw hi nasep sia kei hong piakna thu, na za takpi zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian in a tupku sia hong lak a, kei hong hesak hi. (Hi thu a tom in kong at zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kong lai at sa sia na sim uh le, Christ thuku ka heakna thu na he tu uh hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hun bosa sungah tua thuku sia mihingte tungah kison ngawl a, ahizong tu in Pathian in a thiangtho sawltakte le a kamsaangte tungah Thaa taw lak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A thuku sia bang ziam cile Gentile te le Jew te in Pathian thupha sia lungdamna thu hangin saang khawm thei hi; amate in pumpi khat ii nate hi tek a, Pathian ii Christ Jesus tungtawn a kamciam a piakte nga tek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama ii vaangletna tungtawnin Pathian ii a tuam vilvelin hong piak letsong taw kei sia lungdamna thuhil naseampa ka suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keima in Pathian ii mihingte sung pan a nobel sia sangin a nozaw lai pa ka hi hi; tua hi napi in, a kison zo ngawl Christ ii hauna Lungdamna Thupha Gentile te tungah a puak tu in Pathian in hamphatna hong pia hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tuaciang mihing theampo in, koi bangin Pathian thuku sia kiseam thei tu ziam ci in a mu thei natu in hong seamsak hi. Vantung ngam ah vantunglalang a ukte le vaangletna a neite ii, Pathian ii ciimna a tuatuamte, tu hun sungah pawlpi tungtawnin a heak thei natu in, na theampo a bitphua Pathian in a thuku sia a bosa khang hunte sungah seal top hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hi thu sia Pathian in ih Topa Christ Jesus tungtawnin a kitaksua ama ii tawntung tupna taw kizui in a vawt ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Christ taw ih kikopna le ama sungah ih upna hu in, Pathian omna munah kimuanna le hanna taw ih pai ngam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua zawkciang, note atu in thuak ka hihang, na thin a kiam ngawl natu in kong thuum hi; tuate theampo sia noma phattuam natu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hi thu hu in ih Pa mai ah ka khupdin hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />ama tung pan vantung le leitung ah a om innkuan sim in a min maan a nga uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathian in ama ii a kicing minthanna panin a Thaa tungtawnin, na sungsang mi sia hong hatsak natu in, vaang hong piak natu kong ngetsak hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />na upna hangin note thinsung ah Christ hong teangin, ki itna thu ah zung thuk le, bulkip na nei natu in thu ka ngen hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />tuasia ciang note le Pathian ii mihingte theampo in Christ itna ii a zaina le a sauna, a saanna le a thuknate heak theina na nei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Christ hong itna a kicing takin, kihe thei ngeingawl tu ahitazong, ama hong itna he thei in, Pathianzia mama taw na kidim sitset natu in, thu ka ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ih sungah a vaangletna taw hong sep hu in, ei ii nget thei le ngaisut theiza sangin tamzaw pek a seam thei pa:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pathian tungah pawlpi sung le Christ sungah minthanna sia hun theampo atu in a tawntung a tawntungin om tahen! Amen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Topa ii na ka sep hu in, thongtaak keima in, Pathian ii note hong sap hun laitakin hong koisak bang nuntakna zia taw na nuntak natu in, kong hanthawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A tawntungin kiniamkhiak in, cinghkamh in, na thinsausak tavun. Khat le khat kidualna taw itna kilak tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na kilemna tungtawn a Thaa ii hong piak, no hong ngawmtua kipumkhatna sia ahi theiza in na keamcing tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Note Pathian ii hong sapna sungah lametna khat a om bangma in, pumpi khat om a, Thaa khat om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa khat, upna khat, baptize na khat om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mihing theampo ii Pathian le Pa khat bek om hi, tua Pathian in mihing theampo ii Topa hi a, ama in mihing theampo tungtawnin naseam a, mihing theampo sungah om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Eite theampo in Christ hong piakna taw kizui in, letsong a tuam khat tek ih nga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Laithiangtho in, “A saang mama na munah a paito lai in, ngalmat tam mama tonpui to hi. Ama in mihingte tungah tel pia hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tu in, “Ama a paito hi,” a ci sia bang ci nuam ziam? A cinopna sia lei a thuk belna ah, paisuk masa zo hi, a cinopna hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahikom a paisuk pa sia vaannuai buppi ah a om siat natu in vantungte kalhin, a paitopa ma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Mihingte tungah, letsong hong pia sia” ama ahi hi, pawlkhatte sawltak nasep, pawlkhat sia kamsaang nasep, a dangte thupha puak nasep, pawlpi keam le lai hil sya nasep pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Christ ii pumpi a kisak to natu in Tapidaw nasepna ah sep natu in, ama in hi bangin, Pathian ii mihingte theampo puuakhol natu in vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian Tapa ih heakna le ih upna sungah pumkhat ih sua natu in eite theampo ih kingawmkhawm tu hi; mihing puicingte ih suak tu a, Christ ii tun tan le a phakcia ih banto tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaciangin phuatawm thimthel pilna taw ngualtheam a, a thuhilna uh taw ngual a lampialsak thei te hu in vuivak kikheal pawpo le tui kihual pawpo ii a paipui patangte na hi nawn buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ki itna thinsung nei in thumaan ih sonna taw lutang ahi Christ sangah a nanamin ih khangto zaw tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama ii ukna nuai ah pumpi ii a nate theampo kisi linlian a hong kipiasa kipee-awnate in, hong len khawm diimdiam hi. Tua ahikom pumpi sung na a tuatuamte in ahi tu bangin hong sep ciangin pumpi bup hong khang a, ki itna tungtawnin ama le ama hong kisa to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahikom, Topa min taw kidop natu thu kong pia hi: a khua ngaisutna uh a mannung ngawl Pathian he ngawl mihingte bangin na nungta heak vun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />amate thinsung sia khuazingcip hi. Pathian piak nuntak ziate sungah amate atu bangma om ngawl hi, banghang ziam cile amate in heakna nei ngawlin a thin uh pui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate in maizum he vet nawn ngawl hi, amate in ngamtatna pha ngawlte sungah ki aap uh a, a thasiathuai thu tuatuamte sungah cizat nei ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Christ tung pan na sin uhte in tuabang hi ngawl hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama thu sia na zaak takpi sa uh hi a, note a nungzuite na hina uh taw Jesus sungah thumaan thu note hong kihil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nidang a na nuntakziate uh taw hong nungtasak na milui uh — a maan ngawl duna le deinate ii a lalcipsak na milui uh sia vawkkeak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na thinsung uh le na ngaisutna uh sia a thak sitset na suaksak tavun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />tuaciangin, Pathian lim bangin kivawt a, a thiangtho, a thutang le nuntakna maan taw ama le ama hong kilak, na mithak suana uh sia na silh tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ahiciang, leilot thu son nawn heak vun! Mihing sim in a thu uppuite tungah thumaan son tahen, banghang ziam cile eite in Christ ii pumpi sungah nate ih hi khawm siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na thin uh a uuk le, na thin uukna in, mawna sung thensak heak vun, thin uukna taw na nivui heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Doaimangpa hunpha na ngasak heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ngual neisa a suttol thei sia in sutolna kheal tahen a, ama nuntak natu a thalaw natu le a zawngte a hu thei natu in, naseam tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kamsia pau heak vun, kammal manphate bek pau vun; kitaangsapna sungah a kizangh thei le hong sato thei kammalte pau vun, tua hile hong za po in, phattuamna nga tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pathian ii suatak hong piak tu Ni kipsakna le Pathian neisa na hina hong ciamtee Pathian Thaa Thiangtho khuangaisak heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Thin natna, thin tomna le thin uukna theampo na vawk vun. Ki oksatna ahibuale kiselnona, ki etsatna a tuatuamte theampo vawk vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Khat le khat tungah kithuthiam zaw vun a, thinneam tavun, Christ tungtawnin Pathian ii note mawna hong maisak bangma in, note zongh khat le khat mawna kimaisak tavun.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Note sia Pathian ii it a tate na hi uh komin, ama bang na hi natu hanciam vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Christ in hong it a, Pathian diksak ngimnamtui biakpiakna le sangaw biakpiakna bangin, a nuntakna hong piak bangma, itna in na nuntakna uh uksak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Note in Pathian ii mihingte na hi bangma in, numei le pa paktatna, a thasiathuai nuntakna le duhopnate note sungah son tu in zongh na nei vet heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kampauna sungah a kiihuai, a nin kammal le zummawk kammalte na zak tu uh zongh kilawm ngawl a, Pathian tungah lungdamkona kam na pau tu uh hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A kuama po a paktatte, a thasiathuai a, a kithoaite le a duhopte (duhop sia milim biakna nam khat hi) in Pathian le Christ Ngam lua ngeingawl tu hi ci sia pha takin na he uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mawmawt kammal taw kuama in theamsak heak vun; hi thute mama hu in, Pathian ii thin uukna sia ama ii thu a ni ngawlte tungah tung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahikom tuabang mihingte taw kizopna nei heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Noma mama zongh khuazing sungah om ngei na hi uh hang Topa mihingte na sua uh ciangin, khuavak sungah na om uh hi. Tua ahiciang khuavak ii neisa mihingte bangin na nungta tavun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tua khuavak in na a pha theampo, thutang suana le thumaanna hong puak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa ii diksak thute sin vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mihingte ii sep le vawt khuazing taw a kipawl a mannung ngawlte na thutha heak vun a, tua ngamtatnate khuavak sungah then siat zaw tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />(Amate ii khuazing sungah a sep a vawt kute sia son tu zongh in maizumhuai lei hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaciang na theampo khuavak sungah hong kipusua tak ciang, amate pianzia babang thiang takin hong kilangh tu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />banghang ziam cile a thiang takin a kilangh na khat pawpo sia khuavak suak hi. Tua hu in hi bangin kici hi; “A mutthippa awng, khanglo in, tuaciang thina pan tho in, tua hile Christ sia nang tungah hong taang tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahikom na nuntakzia kidawm in, heakmeal nei ngawlte bangin na nungta heak vun a, a ciimte bangin na nungta vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hunpha na nga simin, a pha in zangh in, banghang ziam cile tu hun in ngitlo hun ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahikom mawmaw heak vun a, Topa in nang sia bang vawt le hong oai ziam cisia na heak tu in na hanciam vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />No hong lalsak thei, sapittui na kham heak vun: Thaa taw na kidim zaw tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Psalm late, biakna late le la thiangtho te ii kammalte taw khat le khat na kipaupui tavun; biakna late le psalm late sa in, na thinsung theampo taw Topa pok vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa Jesus Christ min taw na theampo atu in Pathian ahi Pa tungah a tawntungin lungdam ko tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Christ na thasiana uh taw khat le khat tungah thu kinitna nei tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zite awng, Topa ii thu na nit uh bangin na pasalte ii thu ni tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Christ in pawlpi tungah thu a nei bangma in, pasalte in zite tungah thu nei hi: tuaciangin Christ sia a pumpi ahi pawlpi ii Hunpa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pawlpi in Christ tungah thunitna a nei bangma in, zite in pasalte tungah a khawng a kheakin thunitna nei tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pasalte awng, na zite it vun. Christ in Pawlpi it a, a nuntakna a piak bangin na zite na it vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Pawlpi sia thiangtho a, sit baang ngawl, paubanna om ngawl a, Pathian kammal ahi tui taw a kisilthiang zawkciang Pathian tungah tua pawlpi a ki aap thei natu in pawlpi atu Christ kipia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuabang ma in pasalte in amate pumpi a it bangma in, a zite a it natu ahi hi. Pasal khat a zi a itpa in, ama le ama ki it ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />(Kuama in ama ii pumpi a ensan a om bua hi. Christ ii pawlpi tungah a vawt bangma in, mihingte in a pumpi sia anvaak in ou zaw hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />banghang ziam cile eite in ama pumpi ii nate ih hi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Laithiangtho ii, “Hi thu hangin pa khat in a nu le a pa nusia tu a, a zi taw a kop tu hi. Tuaciangin amate nii sia khat suak tu hi,” a ci bangma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Laithiangtho sungah a thuk mama thuku khat kipualaak a, tua thu in Christ le pawlpi atu ahi hunlam ka tel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahihang tuasia in note tung zongh ah kizangh thei hi; pasal khat simin ama le ama a ki it bangin a zi it tu a, zite khat simin a pasal zakta tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tate awng, nute pate thu na nit tu uh sia na Tapidaw vaipuak hi a, hisia in a maan sep tu sia ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Na nu le na pa zakta in,” a ci sia kamciam taw a kizui thupiak masabel ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Tua hile na theampo sungah na khangto tu a, leitung ah na khansau tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nute pate awng, na tate thin uuk natu in vawt heak vun. Tapidawte kitekna le kihilna taw khangtosak zaw vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Silate awng, na leitung tote sia kiitakna le liinna taw a thu ni vun; tuabangin na hi uh ciang, Christ atu a seam bangma in thinsung takpi taw seam vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hong kipok tu thangaina taw amate hong mu sung teng bekin, tuabangin ngamta heak vun a; Christ ii sila bangin, Pathian dei sia na thin theampo taw seam vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sila na hina uh taw na na sep uh ciangin, mihingte bek atu seam hi ngawlin Topa atu a seam bangin maitai takin naseam vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in sila hikale sila ngawl hikale mihing sim ii a sep nasep pha tungtaang ah thaman pia tu ci in na phawk tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />To ahite awng, silate tungah tuabang ma in na ngamta vun a, tawnna kam na zangh nawn heak vun. Note le na silate in vantung ah Topa khat nei khawm a, tua pa in a kikhaikim in mihing khat sim tungah thu hong khen tu hi ci in phawk tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A khakbel in, Topa taw kikopna pan le ama ii vaangletna lianpi taw na thahat tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Doaimangpa ngitlo theamnate na nalh zawk natu in, Pathian hong piak ngalvanhte theampo na silh vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile eite in mihing ngal ih do bua a, vantung a thaa ngilote hatna, a ukte, thuneite, hi khuazing hun sungah vaangletna neite ih do hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahiciang tu in Pathian ngalvanhte silh vun! Tua hile hun ngilo ni hong thet ciangin ngalte ii hong simna te na nalh zo tu uh a, a tawp dongin na sim zawk uh ciang na dinmun kip lai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahiciang, thumaan thutak sia na kawng ah kawngkhau bang, thutang suana sia awmdalna bang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lungdamna Thupha thansak tu kinginna sia peangdap bangin zanghin, a kithoaisa in om vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hun theampo sungah upna sia lum bangin toai vun; banghang ziam cile tua taw Ngilopa hong kaapna thaltang kuangte theampo na tulmit thei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ngupna sia thik lukhu bangin na saang vun a, tuaciangin Pathian kammal sia Thaa ii hong piak namsau bangin na zangh vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hite theampo thungetna taw seam vun a, Pathian munah huna na ngen vun. Thaa ii hong lampui bangin, hun theampo sungah thu na ngen vun. Hi thu hu in pilvangin, thinkiam ngei heak vun; Pathian ii mihingte theampo atu thu na ngen tawntung vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lungdamna thuku sia hangsan tak le ngual ii tel tu ka son thei natu in, son tu ka kithoai ciang, Pathian ii ka son tu thu hong hil natu kei atu zongh thu hong ngetsak tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tu laitakin, thonginn sungah om ka hi hang, hi lungdamna thu atu in, keima sia tongciin ka hi hi. Lungdamna thu ka son tu bang a, hangsan takin ka son ngam natu thu hong ngetsak tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bangbangin om khi ziam ci in na heak thei natu in, Topa nasepna sungah thumaan naseam ih suapuipa Tychicus in kei huvau thu thakte hong son tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuasia hu in, kote ka vekpi in bangbangin om khu ziam ci thu hong son tu le, note hong hanthawn tu in — ama note kungah kong paisak laitak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pa Pathian le Topa Jesus Christ in Tapidaw suapui theampo tungah thinnopna le ki itna, upna taw hong pia khawm tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A thi ngei ngawl itna taw ih Topa Jesus Christ a it te theampo tungah Pathian ii thuthiamna hong om tahen.
  </para>
</usx>
